  "html": "<article id=\"post-4938\" class=\"container post-4938 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized area-of-service-air-conditioning type-of-service-inspect-repair\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">A/C Emergency Repair: When to Call Right Away</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2019-10-17T04:09:00+00:00\">October 17, 2019</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2026-05-07T16:05:24+00:00\">May 7, 2026</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1971\" src=\"/images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-300x231.jpg 300w, /images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-1024x788.jpg 1024w, /images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-768x591.jpg 768w, /images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-1536x1183.jpg 1536w, /images/2025/04/50-Off-Repairs-Over-250-2048x1577.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Carolina summers are beautiful, but your feelings of Raleigh can easily change if you suddenly find yourself without air conditioning. Without the coastal breeze, the city can get quite sweltering, especially in July and August, so what are you supposed to do if your A/C breaks, and you can’t get an appointment to fix it soon enough? The following questions can help you determine whether or not you should request emergency repair services from reputable technicians.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Hot is It?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>If you’re lucky, your air conditioning will stop working when it’s cool enough to keep your home comfortable by simply opening up the windows and running fans. While it might seem inconvenient, it is certainly a viable option until you can schedule your repairs. However, you might find that the air outside is too warm, so it just makes the situation worse. Instead of suffering in the unbearable heat, you should pick up the phone and make an emergency call .</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Is Your Family at Risk?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Secondly, you should not waste another second if you have any family members who are sensitive to heat. While most people are at risk for heat stroke or exhaustion during the summer, the elderly, newborn infants, and people with any life-threatening illnesses have a higher risk. In fact, some conditions can be downright deadly. The same can be true for your four-legged companions. In order to protect your family and pets, it’s better not to take any chances when you find yourself without air conditioning this summer.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Long Would You Have to Wait?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Lastly, you might be okay for the night, but what if your air conditioner goes out on a Friday, and you can’t wait until Monday for repairs? If you don’t want to sweat all through the weekend, it might be better to opt for emergency solutions in this case. However, the call is ultimately up to you!</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Solutions and Preventative Measures</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>If you have deemed your situation an absolute emergency, you don’t want to waste more time trying to find an A/C repair company you can trust. Instead, you should search for experts before you need them. Fortunately, you don’t have to look far to find the experienced technicians of Happy Home Heating &amp; Cooling. As a certified company, we offer emergency A/C solutions no matter the time of day. If you want to prevent the entire situation altogether, you can also take advantage of our preventative maintenance services.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To request your emergency repairs or routine maintenance, we encourage you to reach out to our A/C specialists in Raleigh right away. You can call to speak with one of our friendly service representatives who are available day or night. If you have more time, you can submit our online form to request a free quote for our other heating and cooling services.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a